{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t薄扶林道晚上發生火警，一名男子送院後不治。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方表示，晚上近9時接報，薄扶林道恆輝大廈發生火警，消防救出一名年約70歲的男子，昏迷送往瑪麗醫院搶救，其後證實不治，至於起火原因有待調查。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T16:22:13.867754+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:48:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T18:17:49.565946+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T16:18:13.225301+00:00","content_hash":"d3adc06f5a67ca1331319fbec0fd4dfe5f8f92d7f284a71219870e797fc7cc7e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}